# Ruthenium · Ru · gate 44

**Ruthenium** (Ru) is element **44** of the periodic table — a **transition metal**, period 5, group 8, d-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **101.07**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
Hardens platinum; a catalyst and a data-storage layer; one of the platinum-group rarities.

## The gate (silicon layer — the 118 Gates)
Under David Wise's four-state cycle, gate **44** falls on **1:1** because (Z−1) mod 4 = **3**. That state is *the held balance — fully manifest, matched, made — born of the world* — the nature of emergence here is **natural**. Ruthenium is not a thing apart; it is the one stochastic element, caught at this beat of its cycle.

## Emergence — natural
This emergent carries the **natural** nature: the same four — natural · ethereal · spiritual · electrical — that run through every sphere of UD0. Its color is `#5fae7a`.

